" branch main: upstream archived `master` (2025-05) and the rewrite lives on `main`.
" The archived master breaks on nvim >= 0.12: its `set-lang-from-info-string!`
" directive handler calls vim.treesitter.get_node_text() on the new-style node
" (a plain table), while nvim's get_range() still calls node:range() ->
" "attempt to call method 'range' (a nil value)" on every markdown parse.
call dein#add('nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter', {'rev': 'main', 'do': ':TSUpdate'})
