" nvim-scrollbar v2 (migrated 2026-10-22). v2 replaces v1 on `main` on
" 2026-11-16 (petertriho/nvim-scrollbar#121) and both scrollbar setup blocks in
" packages/nvim were rewritten to the v2 option shape. dein's key is `rev`
" (a revision, branch or tag) — there is no `branch` key. Until 2026-11-16 the
" v2 code lives on `refactor/v2`, so that branch is pinned; after that date
" `main` carries v2 and this rev line can simply be dropped.
call dein#add("petertriho/nvim-scrollbar", {'rev': 'refactor/v2'})
call dein#add('uga-rosa/ccc.nvim')
call dein#add("luukvbaal/statuscol.nvim")  " RESTORED 2026-09-08 — snacks.statuscolumn didn't work out

